[7425]="7005A5F6\n1\tTalk to Mekhnet\tBefore delving deeper into Atrad-zarakh, you should talk to Mekhnet.\n2\tDefend Mekhnet\tYou should help defend Mekhnet.\n3\tTalk to Mekhnet\tYou have found Thraunákh, though Mekhnet wishes to speak with you before facing him.\n4\tDefend Mekhnet\tYou should defend Mekhnet as you both face Thraunákh.\n5\tTalk to Mekhnet\tThraunákh has been defeated.\n",
[7426]="70048BFD\n1\tPresent yourself to the Knight of Dulgabêth at Amon Thaur\tYou have come in disguise to the base of Amon Thaur. Will Dulgabêth's knights permit you to gain access to the meeting?\n2\tClimb the stairs at Amon Thaur and look for other Nurnhoth slaves\tOther slaves have already arrived. You should climb the stairs at Amon Thaur and join them.\n3\tJoin the Nurnhoth slaves to the south-east, among the pillars of Amon Thaur\tYou can see other slaves to the south-east of the landing, among the pillars of Amon Thaur. You should join them in order to avoid arousing the suspicion of the enemy.\n4\tTalk to the Nurnhoth slave\tYou can see other slaves to the south-east of the landing, among the pillars of Amon Thaur. You should join them in order to avoid arousing the suspicion of the enemy.\n5\tObserve the meeting of the Masters, and remain beneath their notice\tYou have infiltrated the meeting of the Masters of Mordor at Amon Thaur, on the slopes of Mount Doom.\n6\tObserve the meeting of the Masters, and remain beneath their notice\tYou have infiltrated the meeting of the Masters of Mordor at Amon Thaur, on the slopes of Mount Doom.\n7\tObserve the meeting of the Masters, and remain beneath their notice\tYou have infiltrated the meeting of the Masters of Mordor at Amon Thaur, on the slopes of Mount Doom.\n8\tTalk to the Nurnhoth slave\tLhaereth has summoned one of the Nurnhoth slaves.\n9\tPick up the fallen pouch where it lies\tThe slave dropped a pouch when he died, and now Laereth calls for you to bring it to her.\n10\tBring the fallen pouch to Lhaereth the Stained\tYou collected the fallen pouch, and now Lhaereth wants you to bring it to her.\n11\tObserve the meeting of the Masters, and remain beneath their notice\tLhaereth has commanded you to remain where you are.\n12\tEscape down the stairs without being discovered\tDulgabêth and his knights have been betrayed. You should escape down the stairs and away from Amon Thaur before it is too late for you to get away!\n13\tEscape down the stairs without being discovered\tDulgabêth and his knights have been betrayed. You should escape down the stairs and away from Amon Thaur before it is too late for you to get away!\n",
[7427]="7006CDFD\n1\tTalk to Amâsu\tAmâsu and Girhâzi have followed you into the salt mine tunnels once more. You should talk to Amâsu.\n2\tLead Amâsu and Girhâzi to the odd wall\tAmâsu and Girhâzi have followed you into the salt mine tunnels once more. You should lead them to the odd wall you found.\n3\tThink about which way to go from the first crossway\tAmâsu and Girhâzi have followed you into the salt mine tunnels once more. You should lead them to the odd wall you found.\n4\tTalk to Amâsu\tAmâsu and Girhâzi have followed you into the salt mine tunnels once more. With Girhâzi's help, you have thwarted an attack by giant scorpions. Amâsu would like to talk to you.\n5\tLead Amâsu and Girhâzi to the odd wall\tAmâsu and Girhâzi have followed you into the salt mine tunnels once more. You should lead them to the odd wall you found.\n6\tThink about which way to go from the second crossway\tAmâsu and Girhâzi have followed you into the salt mine tunnels once more. You should lead them to the odd wall you found.\n7\tTalk to Girhâzi\tAmâsu and Girhâzi have followed you into the salt mine tunnels once more. Girhâzi wants to talk to you.\n8\tLead Amâsu and Girhâzi to the odd wall\tAmâsu and Girhâzi have followed you into the salt mine tunnels once more. You should lead them to the odd wall you found.\n9\tJoin Amâsu and Girhâzi at the wall\tAmâsu and Girhâzi have followed you into the salt mine tunnels once more. You should join them at the odd wall.\n10\tTalk to Amâsu\tAmâsu and Girhâzi have followed you into the salt mine tunnels once more. Amâsu wants to talk to you.\n11\tObserve Girhâzi and Amâsu\tAmâsu and Girhâzi have followed you into the salt mine tunnels once more, and have led them to the odd wall you found. You should listen to their conversation.\n12\tObserve Girhâzi and Amâsu\tAmâsu and Girhâzi have followed you into the salt mine tunnels once more, and have led them to the odd wall you found. You should listen to their conversation.\n13\tTalk to Girhâzi\tAmâsu and Girhâzi have followed you into the salt mine tunnels once more. After leading them to the odd wall you found, they were able to open the secret door, discovering the Dubarâkh. Girhâzi wants to talk to you.\n",
[7428]="70034289\n1\tHabla con Gléowine fuera de Dunfast\tGléowine está fuera del pueblo, esperando para hablar contigo.\n2\tHabla con Corudan en Dunfast\tCorudan siente que están siendo observados.\n3\tExplora Dunfast con Horn, Corudan y Gléowine\tHorn, Corudan y Gléowine están explorando Dunfast, y tú deberías hacer lo mismo.\n4\tHabla con Horn en Dunfast\tHorn cree que ha encontrado al misterioso observador de Corudan, y está listo para aprovechar la oportunidad de revelarlo.\n5\t¡Prepárate para cualquier cosa! Horn está listo para atrapar al misterioso observador en Dunfast\tHorn está listo para atrapar al misterioso observador en Dunfast.\n6\tHorn podría usar tu ayuda para ponerse de pie y salvar tanta dignidad como sea posible.\t\n7\tSientes que alguien los está observando a los cuatro\tTodavía sientes una presencia vigilante en Dunfast, y deberías descubrir quién o qué es lo que observa.\n8\tEscucha lo que le sucedió a Nona después de que dejó tu compañía en el Valle del Entwash\tNona ha regresado, pero no parece feliz de verte. ¿Qué significará esto para Horn?\n9\tHabla con Horn en Dunfast\030Habla con Corudan en Dunfast\030Habla con Gléowine en Dunfast\tHorn está desanimado tras tu encuentro con Nona en el pueblo vacío de Dunfast.\n",
[7429]="7000040F\n1\tHabla con Strider\tTrancos y sus parientes, Torthann y Lenglinn, te han conducido a las afueras del campamento de los bandidos. Trancos te hace señas.\n2\tHabla con Torthann\tTrancos te ha dicho que hables con Torthann cuando estés [según el diario] para comenzar la búsqueda de Amdir. Trancos y Lenglinn encontrarán una entrada por detrás.\n3\tHabla con Torthann\tTorthann percibió la fuente del miedo de los bandidos en la esquina sur del campamento. Debería investigar.\n4\tHabla con Torthann\tTorthann no está convencido de que el mal finalice con el tumulario y cree que Amdir está en algún lugar cercano. Tal vez haya algo más en el campamento.\n5\tTorthann te llama.\t\n",
[7430]="70047BEA\n1\tTalk to Faramir at Ondoher's Folly\tFaramir is just outside Ondoher's Folly in Dagorlad. You should speak to Faramir when you are ready to assault Ondoher's Folly and confront the Bloodletter.\n2\tDefeat every Orc at Ondoher's Folly\tOrcs can be found throughout Ondoher's Folly. Faramir has asked you to aid him in defeating the Orcs of Ondoher's Folly so the Wainriders remain deceived upon their arrival.\n3\tConfront Burudagath the Bloodletter\tBurudagath the Bloodletter is outside the Fane of Screaming at Ondoher's Folly. You have defeated every Orc in Ondoher's Folly and should now confront Burudagath.\n4\tAttempt to free yourself from Burudagath the Bloodletter\tYou are trapped in the Fane of Screaming at Ondoher's Folly.\n5\tObserve the confrontation between Zhan Ashû and Burudagath\tThe Wainriders have come to Ondoher's Folly and are now confronting Burudagath the Bloodletter.\n6\tRemain on guard as Zhan Ashû speaks\tZhan Ashû is addressing you before the Wainriders return to Dol Acharn.\n7\tListen to Burudagath\tBurudagath has survived his encounter with the Wainriders, but appears to be severely wounded.\n8\tTalk to Faramir inside the Fane of Screaming at Ondoher's Folly\tFaramir can be found at Ondoher's Folly. Burudagath has been defeated and Faramir has reappeared within the Fane of Screaming at Ondoher's Folly.\n",
[7431]="70044D57\n1\tTalk to Gúldil\tGúldil can be found in the Old Archives. Gúldil has offered to help you confront the thief in the Old Archives. You should speak to him.\n2\tSearch the Old Archives for the scroll-thief\tThe area Gúldil mentioned can be found in the back of the Old Archives on the second floor. Gúldil has asked you to search the second floor of the Old Archives.\n3\tListen to the scroll-thief\tThe scroll-thief can be found in the back of the Old Archives, on the left side of the second floor. You have found the man you presume to be the scroll-thief and should now confront him.\n4\tConfront Nobor\tNobor can be found in the back of the Old Archives, on the left side of the second floor. Nobor has revealed his intent. You must convince him to abandon his plans against the Steward!\n5\tDerrota a Vadokhar\tVadokhar can be found in the back of the Old Archives, on the left side of the second floor. Vadokhar has appeared in the Old Archives. You should defeat the rogmul before it can cause any more harm.\n6\tExamine Nobor\tNobor can be found in the back of the Old Archives, on the left side of the second floor. Nobor was slain by the summoning of the rogmul. You should examine his body before leaving the Old Archives.\n",
[7432]="7005491C\n1\tReturn to Faeron\tWith Rhadrog and Dolenthol in tow, you should return to Faeron and see how you can help.\n2\tEscucha la conversación\tDolenthol has just learned that Viznak is actually a goblin. You should listen to the conversation.\n3\tDefeat the merrevail\tYou are under attack! Defeat the merrevail attackers!\n4\tEscucha la conversación\tViznak has regained consciousness and is speaking with the Rangers. You should listen to the conversation.\n",
[7433]="7006C6EA\n1\tSpeak with Raphûz to begin the search for Ashâmi\tRaphûz is preparing for battle through the grove to find Ashâmi.\n2\tCautiously approach Ashâmi\tYou and Raphûz discovered Ashâmai amongst a section of dead trees in the grove. She does not look happy to see you. Approach her and allow Raphûz to explain why you are here.\n3\tWait for Raphûz and Ashâmi to finish speaking\tYou approached Ashâmi in the ruined grove. Allow Raphûz and her to speak.\n4\tDefeat the Alad of Er-atûr\030Assist Ashâmi and Raphûz to defeat the Alad\tAshâmi is concerned you and Raphûz are over-matched in the fallen grove. She warns that the Alad is a powerful creature and suggests you may not survive this attack. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n5\tSpeak with Raphûz\tAshâmi begins the grisly business of collecting a trophy from the Alad. Raphûz shifts nervously.\n6\tAllow Ashâmi and Raphûz to finish their discussion\tAshâmi finishes her task and she and Raphûz move to speak to one another. Allow them to have their conversation.\n7\tSpeak with Raphûz\tAs Ashâmi begins to walk away, Raphûz looks at you excitedly and smiles. You should speak with him.\n",
[7434]="70066DD8\n1\tTalk to Caebar on the deck of the Wave-hunter\tCaebar stands on the deck of the Wave-hunter, already concerned about something.\n2\tBeckon for Daxamat to come down\tCaebar is worried that Daxamat will fall, and he has asked you to beckon the Corsair to come down.\n3\tWait with your crew\tSpirits are light as the Wave-hunter begins its voyage to Umbar.\n4\tTalk to Sirgon on the deck of the Wave-hunter\tSirgon stands on the deck of the Wave-hunter as its voyage begins.\n5\tSirgon recommended that you speak with the crew-members you recruited for the voyage as the Wave-hunter sails to Umbar.\t\n6\tTalk to Caebar below decks in the Wave-hunter\tAs he said he would, Caebar prefers to remain below decks.\n7\tGo back up on deck\tCaebar has suggested you go above and take in the fresh air.\n8\tTalk to Sigileth on the deck of the Wave-hunter\tSigileth stands on the deck of the Wave-hunter.\n9\tListen to the concerns of your crew\tSome members of your crew discuss the situation that awaits them in Umbar.\n10\tTalk to Daxamat and learn about Umbar\tDaxamat has agreed to tell you what he can about the City of the Corsairs.\n11\tWhen you have learned enough, find Caebar below decks\tCaebar is below decks, waiting to hear how the crew is enjoying the voyage.\n12\tTalk to Sirgon inside the Wave-hunter\tSirgon calls for you as the storm rages outside and the Wave-hunter is tossed on wild seas.\n13\tGo up on deck and weather the storm\tThe storm rages!\n14\tTalk to Legolas on the deck of the Wave-hunter\tLegolas calls for your help.\n15\tFind the Wave-hunter\tThrown from the ship during the storm, you have washed ashore and must now return to the Wave-hunter.\n16\tMeet with Sirgon\tWaterlogged but alive, you have found where the Wave-hunter ran aground on the Shield Isles.\n",
[7435]="70053B32\n1\tTalk to Gandalf in the Halls of Memory\tGandalf is in the Halls of Memory, ready to read the secret writing of Vóin's tale.\n2\tHidden within the secret runes, Vóin speaks of his journey to Mordor.\t\n3\tVóin joined a group of wicked dwarves bound for service in Minas Morgul.\t\n4\tListen to Vóin's tale as recorded in the secret runes\tThe hidden runes left by Vóin in the Black Book of Mordor describe the time he spent within Minas Morgul, seeking to free Eärnur.\n5\tThe hidden runes left by Vóin in the Black Book of Mordor describe the time he spent within Minas Morgul, seeking to free Eärnur.\t\n6\tHear the words of Eärnur\tVóin recorded the words of Eärnur in hidden runes within the Black Book of Mordor.\n7\tListen to Eärnur's plan as recorded by Vóin in the secret runes\tVóin recorded the words of Eärnur in hidden runes within the Black Book of Mordor.\n8\tHidden within the secret runes, Vóin speaks of the dungeons of Minas Morgul.\t\n9\tListen to Vóin's tale as recorded in the secret runes\tThe hidden runes left by Vóin in the Black Book of Mordor describe a difficult choice made within the dungeons of Minas Morgul.\n10\tVóin writes of his difficult choice in the dungeons of Minas Morgul, and his words return to the slopes of Mordor.\t\n11\tTalk to Gandalf on the slopes of Mordor, as depicted by the Halls of Memory\tGandalf has finished reading the hidden runes Vóin left within the Black Book of Mordor.\n",
[7436]="7002EFE0\n1\tEscucha la decisión del Thane Utred sobre el destino de Largafortín\tEl Thane Utred de Largafortín tiene una decisión que tomar. Debes hablar con el Thane de Largafortín.\n2\tObserva la conversación del Thane con su familia\tEl Thane Utred está en el Salón del Hidromiel de Largafortín. Debes escuchar la conversación del Thane con su familia y luego seguirlos afuera cuando terminen de hablar.\n3\tComprueba si Utred está bien\tEl Thane Utred está en el Salón del Hidromiel de Largafortín. Debes escuchar la conversación del Thane con su familia y luego seguirlos afuera cuando terminen de hablar.\n4\tSal del Salón del Hidromiel y busca a Cíllan afuera\tEl Thane Utred está en el Salón del Hidromiel de Largafortín. Debes escuchar la conversación del Thane con su familia y luego seguirlos afuera cuando terminen de hablar.\n5\tHabla con Cíllan fuera del Salón del Hidromiel\tCíllan está en los escalones del Salón del Hidromiel. Debes hablar con Cíllan.\n6\tPrepara el corcel de guerra de Utred para llevar a la familia del Thane a un lugar seguro\tDebes encontrar el corcel de guerra de Utred siguiendo a Cíllan y sus hijos.\n7\tAsegúrate de que los habitantes inocentes de Largafortín tengan un comienzo seguro hacia Harwick\tDebes vigilar a las mujeres y los niños que evacúan, y asegurarte de que tengan un comienzo seguro en el camino.\n8\tHabla con Cíllan\tDebes vigilar a las mujeres y los niños que evacúan, y asegurarte de que tengan un comienzo seguro en el camino.\n9\tApresúrate a encontrarte con los invasores en batalla\tLos bandidos invasores están en la puerta norte de Largafortín. Debes apresurarte a la puerta norte y luchar contra los bandidos.\n10\tAyuda a luchar por Largafortín\tObserva la batalla por Largafortín.\n11\tEncuentra a Dala en el caos y síguelo\tEn el caos de la caída de Largafortín, Dala llama tu nombre.\n12\tSigue a Dala\tSigue a Dala.\n",
[7437]="7002EFE6\n1\tHabla con Burnoth\t\n2\tDistrae al guardia que está apostado frente al campamento de los Jinetes\tBurnoth quiere que distraigas al guardia que está apostado frente al campamento de su grupo. Ayuda a los Cuatro Jinetes a escapar sin que los vean.\n3\tLleva a los Cuatro Jinetes a los establos\t\n4\tHabla con Burnoth\t\n5\tLleva a los Cuatro Jinetes a los establos\tLleva a los Cuatro Jinetes a los establos.\n6\tLanza una piedra para distraer al guardia\tHay un montón de piedras cerca de la puerta. Quizá puedas distraer al guardia lanzándole una piedra.\n7\tLleva a los Cuatro Jinetes a los establos\tLleva a los Cuatro Jinetes a los establos.\n8\tHabla con Burnoth\t\n9\tDistrae al perro con la cecina de Burnoth\tUsa la cecina que te dio Burnoth para distraer al perro callejero.\n10\tLleva a los Cuatro Jinetes a los establos\tLleva a los Cuatro Jinetes a los establos.\n11\tConvence a los guardias de que abandonen su puesto\tConvence a los guardias de que abandonen su puesto.\n12\tLleva a los Cuatro Jinetes a los establos\tLleva a los Cuatro Jinetes a los establos.\n13\tHabla con Burnoth\t\n",
[7438]="700266E6\n1\tDestruye la reliquia de Gorothúl en Nalâ-dûm\tBróin cree que una de las reliquias que Gorothúl dejó en Moria fue dada a los merrevail que infestan las Salas de los Espejos de Lumul-nar y quiere que la destruyas.\n2\tDerrota a Caerlûg\tDerrota a Caerlûg, la criatura inmunda que ha tomado residencia en las profundidades de las Ruedas de Agua de Nalâ-dûm.\n",
[7439]="700143E1\n1\tHabla con Frár\tFrár está esperando en el lado occidental del Puente de Khazad-dûm. ¡Frár necesita desesperadamente tu ayuda si los orcos deben ser rechazados!\n2\tHabla con Náli\030Habla con Lóni\tLóni y Náli están en el lado este del Puente de Khazad-dûm. Has luchado hasta llegar a los enanos al otro lado del puente y deberías hablar con ellos sobre la situación crítica.\n3\tHabla con Frár\tFrár, Lóni y Náli han decidido hacer una última resistencia contra los orcos. Tú, Ori, estarás con ellos.\n4\tEspera a que Frár decida qué hacer\tFrár está en el pasaje al este del Puente de Khazad-dûm. Tu resistencia contra los orcos te ha llevado a ti y a Frár al pasaje al este del puente.\n5\tHabla con Frár\tFrár está en el pasaje al este del Puente de Khazad-dûm. Un gran mal ha llegado a Khazad-dûm, y su sombra ha llenado a Frár de temor. Está esperando para hablar contigo.\n6\tHabla con Thíli\tThíli está en el lado occidental del Puente de Khazad-dûm. Frár ha decidido enfrentar su destino, ralentizando el avance de los males que aún esperan a los enanos para que puedas escapar a la sala Vigesimoprimera con Thíli.\n7\tHabla con Thíli\tThíli está en la sala Vigesimoprimera. Tú y Thíli han escapado de los orcos que se estaban reuniendo en el Puente de Khazad-dûm, pero se están cerrando alrededor de ustedes.\n8\tHabla con Olgir\tUno de los exploradores que enviaste hace días ha regresado a la sala Vigesimoprimera.\n9\tHabla con Thíli\tThíli está en la sala Vigesimoprimera. Te quedan pocos enanos y todo parece perdido. Thíli está esperando para hablar contigo sobre la situación.\n10\tSigue a Thíli hasta la Cámara de Mazarbul\tSiguiendo tu sugerencia, los enanos se están retirando a la Cámara de Mazarbul, que puede ser más fácilmente defendida contra la horda que se aproxima.\n11\tHabla con Thíli\tThíli está en la Cámara de Mazarbul, esperando para hablar contigo mientras el resto de los enanos preparan las defensas.\n12\tTermina de escribir el Libro de Mazarbul\tEl Libro de Mazarbul está sobre la tumba que se erigió para Balin en el centro de la cámara. Thíli te ha pedido que termines de escribir el relato de los enanos en el Libro de Mazarbul.\n13\tSobrevive al asalto de los orcos\tEl asalto final contra los enanos ha comenzado.\n14\tDerrota a Mazog\tMazog, un joven orco descendiente de Azog el trasgo, ha liderado el asalto contra los enanos y debe ser derrotado.\n15\tResiste a Mazog hasta el final\tLos orcos son demasiados, y las fuerzas de Mazog se acercan para dar el golpe fatal.\n",
[7440]="7006D36E\n1\tRaphûz awaits your counsel and assistance to begin\tIn the shadow of an ancient tomb, Raphûz awaits your counsel.\n2\tRaphûz paused his advance and looks in need of reassurance\tYou ventured deeper into the ruins of Nirgambâr. Raphûz's resolve is holding, but he looks nervous.\n3\tTell Raphûz you are ready to claim the chest\tAfter fighting through the dead, you and Raphûz see the treasure he seeks. A small cadre of guards stands between you and Raphûz's goal.\n4\tSpeak with Raphûz\tYou fought your way through the Dead at Nirgambâr to obtain a chest containing riches for Raphûz. Raphûz stands near the prize and looks pleased.\n",
[7441]="7000D5BA\n1\tEncuentra el anillo Narchuil\tEntra en Barad Dúrgul y recupera el anillo Narchuil.\n",
[7442]="7002FEE3\n1\tHabla con Harding\tHarding celebra su consejo en el nivel superior del Salón del Hidromiel de Harwick\n2\tSentarse A la diestra de Harding.\tHarding celebra su consejo en el nivel superior del Salón del Hidromiel de Harwick. Deberías Sentarse A la diestra de Harding. «Esta misión requiere que ejecutes un gesto mientras te encuentras en el lugar indicado.\n3\tDile a Harding que estás [según el diario] para comenzar.\tHarding celebra su consejo en el nivel superior del Salón del Hidromiel de Harwick\n4\tObserva el concilio de Harding\tHarding celebra su consejo en el nivel superior del Salón del Hidromiel de Harwick.\n5\tHabla con Harding, Senescal de El Páramo\tHarding celebra su consejo en el nivel superior del Salón del Hidromiel de Harwick.\n",
[7443]="7004A390\n1\tWatch and listen\tThe meeting is beginning.\n2\tWatch and listen\tThe meeting is underway. The forge-workers are presenting their case.\n3\tTalk to Kurtil\tIt seems that Kurtil wants to whisper something to you.\n4\tWatch and listen\tThe meeting is underway. The two sides do not yet see eye to eye.\n5\tTalk to Kurtil\tThings are not going well. Kurtil has motioned you over.\n6\tWatch and listen\tThe meeting is underway. Can Gradrágh salvage the situation?\n7\tTalk to Gradrágh\tGradrágh has beckoned you over.\n8\tTake down the meeting flag\tGradrágh asked you to pull down the meeting flag, as it is no longer needed and only draws attention to the covert gathering.\n9\tWatch and listen\tThe meeting is underway. Can Gradrágh salvage the situation?\n10\tSee who approaches\tWhat menacing voice spoke those words? See who approaches.\n11\tDefeat the Rogmul Rúthragon\030Defeat Grúshat the Thrasher\t\n12\tAll hope is lost\tThe enforcer and Rogmul are defeated, but the parley is lost beyond hope.\n",
[7444]="7004429F\n1\tTalk to Peregrin Took in the Tower Hall\tPeregrin Took has led you into the Tower of Ecthelion for your audience with Steward Denethor.\n2\tTalk to Denethor in the Tower Hall\tSteward Denethor is in the Tower Hall, waiting to speak with you.\n3\tFollow Denethor\tDenethor wishes to show you something, and has invited you to a secret chamber in the Tower of Ecthelion.\n4\tTalk to Denethor in his secret chamber\tDenethor has brought you to a secret chamber high in the Tower of Ecthelion.\n5\tLook into the depths of the palantír\tDenethor has instructed you to look into the depths of the palantír.\n6\tHazy images swirl before your eyes!\tHazy images swirl before your eyes.\n7\tTalk to Denethor\tHazy images swirl before your eyes.\n8\tHazy images swirl before your eyes!\tHazy images swirl before your eyes.\n9\tTalk to Denethor\tHazy images swirl before your eyes.\n10\tHazy images swirl before your eyes!\tHazy images swirl before your eyes.\n11\tTalk to Denethor\tHazy images swirl before your eyes.\n12\tExamine the captive hobbit\tHazy images swirl before your eyes.\n13\tThe hazy images become more indistinct!\tThe images fade, becoming more and more difficult to see clearly.\n14\tTalk to Denethor in his secret chamber\tYou are standing by the palantír in Denethor's secret chamber, trying to shake the troubling images from your mind. Even so, they linger still.\n",
[7445]="7004CF1D\n1\tCross the bridge and explore the room beyond\tIntense shadow blankets the area. What evils might this forgotten chamber have held before the fall of Sauron?\n2\tWitness the shadowy impressions evil has left upon this chamber\tA powerful presence has left its mark upon this chamber, and fell voices whisper of the past.\n3\tExamine objects within the Room of Voices\tThere may be more to discover within this Room of Voices.\n4\tWitness the shadowy impressions evil has left upon this chamber\tA powerful presence has left its mark upon this chamber, and fell voices whisper of the past.\n5\tExamine objects within the Room of Voices\tThere may be more to discover within this Room of Voices.\n6\tWitness the shadowy impressions evil has left upon this chamber\tA powerful presence has left its mark upon this chamber, and fell voices whisper of the past.\n7\tCautiously investigate the western passage\tSomeone is approaching from the western passage!\n8\tCautiously investigate the western passage\tSomeone is approaching from the western passage!\n9\tTalk to Sigileth in the Room of Voices\tYou thought her dead, but somehow Sigileth of the Hidden Guard is still alive!\n",
[7446]="7004E1E0\n1\tSearch for signs of Karazgar in Gostador\tKarazgar may be found somewhere within the ruins of Gostador. You have returned to Dol Dhannen in search of Karazgar and have descended into Gostador. You should search for Karazgar.\n2\tWitness the shadowy impressions evil has left upon this chamber\tA powerful presence has left its mark upon this chamber, and fell voices whisper of the past.\n3\tExamine objects within the Room of Voices in Gostador\tThere may be more left to discover within the Room of Voices.\n4\tWitness the shadowy impressions evil has left upon this chamber\tA powerful presence has left its mark upon this chamber, and fell voices whisper of the past.\n5\tExamine objects within the Room of Voices in Gostador\tThere may be more left to discover within the Room of Voices.\n6\tWitness the shadowy impressions evil has left upon this chamber\tA powerful presence has left its mark upon this chamber, and fell voices whisper of the past.\n7\tTalk to Sigileth in the Room of Voices\tSigileth is standing at the edge of the Room of Voices in Gostador. You have witnessed many events of Karazgar's past, but did not find Karazgar in Gostador. After waiting for a time, Sigileth has come to find you.\n",
[7447]="70069087\n1\tSpeak with Ayaluk at a building near Ulanor's chambers\tMeet Ayaluk at the edge of the building near the overseer's chambers.\n2\tDistract the guard by clearing your throat /ahem\030Distract the guard with a /hail\030When the guard starts walking again, distract him by waving /bye\tAyaluk asked you to distract the guard while he sneaks into Ulanor's office to find proof of her wrongdoing. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n3\tSpeak with Ayaluk near his original hiding spot\tYou distracted the guard well enough for Ayaluk to search and escape. Return to his hiding spot near the building east of Ulanor's office.\n",
[7448]="7006C4E5\n1\tSpeak with Sigênik to begin your test\tSigênik is prepared to administer his test. Speak to him when you are prepared.\n2\tTell Sigênik yes, Igbâl is the elder allied to the rebellion\030Tell Sigênik no, Igbâl is not the elder allied to the rebellion\tSigênik awaits your response. He asked if Igbâl is the Elder who directly supports the rebellion in Jirush. You should give him your response.\n3\tSpeak with Sigênik to continue your test\tYou provided your answer to Sigênik's question about Igbâl. Speak with him again to continue your test.\n4\tTell Sigênik yes, Zidemel is the elder allied to the rebellion\030Tell Sigênik no, Zidemel is not the elder allied to the rebellion\tSigênik awaits your response. He asked if Zidemel is the elder who directly supports the rebellion in Jirush. You should give him your response.\n5\tSpeak with Sigênik to continue your test\tYou provided your answer to Sigênik's question about Zidemel. Speak with him again to continue your test.\n6\tTell Sigênik yes, Nangar is the elder allied to the rebellion\030Tell Sigênik no, Nangar is not the elder allied to the rebellion\tSigênik awaits your response. He asked if Nangar is the elder who directly supports the rebellion in Jirush. You should give him your response.\n7\tSpeak with Sigênik to continue your test\tYou provided your answer to Sigênik's question about Nangar. Speak with him again to continue your test.\n8\tTell Sigênik yes, Malgat is the elder allied to the rebellion\030Tell Sigênik no, Malgat is not the elder allied to the rebellion\tSigênik awaits your response. He asked if Malgat is the elder who directly supports the rebellion in Jirush. You should give him your response.\n9\tYou provided all of your answers to Sigênik's questions. Speak with him to learn your judgement. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\t\n",
[7449]="7004D022\n1\tTalk to Gandalf at the top of Mazal Akrâz\tGandalf is waiting to speak with you at the top of Mazal Akrâz, the Chamber of Glory.\n2\tDescend the steps in Mazal Akrâz and make your way to the tomb of Thorin Oakenshield\tGandalf agreed to meet you by the tomb of Thorin Oakenshield, at the bottom of Mazal Akrâz, the Chamber of Glory.\n3\tTalk to Dís in Mazal Akrâz\tDís stands by the tomb of her brother and her sons, in Mazal Akrâz, the Chamber of Glory.\n4\tRemain alert while Gandalf and the dwarves open the tomb\tThe dwarves of Thorin's Company, his sister Dís, and Gandalf have come to Mazal Akrâz to see if the Arkenstone remains within.\n5\tTalk to Gandalf in Mazal Akrâz\tGandalf is by the tomb of Thorin Oakenshield, in Mazal Akrâz.\n6\tListen to the words of Gandalf\tRelieved that the Arkenstone remains with Thorin, Gandalf wishes to say a few words to you and to the dwarves.\n7\tListen to Gandalf's lecture on the evolution of words\tRelieved that the Arkenstone remains with Thorin, Gandalf wishes to say a few words to you and to the dwarves.\n8\tTalk to Gandalf in Mazal Akrâz\tGandalf is by the tomb of Thorin Oakenshield, in Mazal Akrâz.\n9\tListen to the words of Gandalf\tGandalf is by the tomb of Thorin Oakenshield, in Mazal Akrâz.\n",
[7450]="7003A679\n1\tSpeak with Gifemund\tSpeak with Gifemund ahead of you. The time has come to re-capture the fountain area, but you will need Gifemund's aid.\n2\tCapture the fountain area\tDefeat the enemy who hold the fountain area in Woodhurst. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n3\tSpeak with Herubrand\tHerubrand has arrived at the fountain. Herubrand wishes to speak with you about the plan to retake the mead hall.\n4\tDefeat the enemy outside the mead hall\tThe enemy has heavily guarded the pathway up to the mead hall, and appear to be guarding the front door.\n5\tSpeak with Herubrand\tHerubrand is standing outside the mead hall door. Herubrand wishes to speak with you after defeating Arnwi.\n6\tFollow the others into the mead hall\tEnter the mead hall with the others. The battle for Woodhurst has progressed into the mead hall.\n7\tSpeak with Herubrand\tHerubrand is within the door of the mead hall. Herubrand wishes to give directions on how the group will approach the coming battle.\n8\tMake your way to the throne\tDefeat the enemy throughout the mead hall and make your way to the throne.\n9\tSpeak with Herubrand\tHerubrand waits to speak with you before approaching those waiting for you at the throne of the mead hall.\n10\tDefeat Thurferth and the enemy at the throne\tThurferth, a White Hand Emissary and a Dunlending named Cadwalader are standing in front of the throne. Those who organized the fall of Woodhurst now boldly claim ownership of the city.\n11\tSpeak with Herubrand\tHerubrand is near the throne in the mead hall. Herubrand would like to thank you for your part in aiding their victory.\n",
[7451]="70047B62\n1\tToma tu lugar\tToma tu lugar entre los invitados.\n",
[7452]="70030DC3\n1\tHabla con Athelward\t«Acompaña al Senescal Athelward al campo de batalla.\n2\tHabla con Reeve Athelward\tAthelward se encuentra en el camino al sur de Cliving. Athelward desea hablar sobre los resultados de tu encuentro con los Orcos y los Uruks.\n",
[7453]="7001CC61\n1\tHabla con Ráthwald\tGhân-gharâf se encuentra muy por debajo de las Profundidades Inundadas, más allá de una serie de cavernas parcialmente inundadas. Bróin desea que presencies el regreso de Zigilburk a Ghân-gharâf. En tu camino, hablarás con muchos de los enanos de la Guarnición de Hierro que has ayudado durante tus viajes dentro de Moria.\n2\tHabla con Tulk\tGhân-gharâf se encuentra muy por debajo de las Profundidades Inundadas, más allá de una serie de cavernas parcialmente inundadas. Bróin desea que presencies el regreso de Zigilburk a Ghân-gharâf. En tu camino, hablarás con muchos de los enanos de la Guarnición de Hierro que has ayudado durante tus viajes dentro de Moria.\n3\tHabla con Wárr\tGhân-gharâf se encuentra muy por debajo de las Profundidades Inundadas, más allá de una serie de cavernas parcialmente inundadas. Bróin desea que presencies el regreso de Zigilburk a Ghân-gharâf. En tu camino, hablarás con muchos de los enanos de la Guarnición de Hierro que has ayudado durante tus viajes dentro de Moria.\n4\tHabla con Hundi\tGhân-gharâf se encuentra muy por debajo de las Profundidades Inundadas, más allá de una serie de cavernas parcialmente inundadas. Bróin desea que presencies el regreso de Zigilburk a Ghân-gharâf. En tu camino, hablarás con muchos de los enanos de la Guarnición de Hierro que has ayudado durante tus viajes dentro de Moria.\n5\tHabla con Sweina\tGhân-gharâf se encuentra muy por debajo de las Profundidades Inundadas, más allá de una serie de cavernas parcialmente inundadas. Bróin desea que presencies el regreso de Zigilburk a Ghân-gharâf. En tu camino, hablarás con muchos de los enanos de la Guarnición de Hierro que has ayudado durante tus viajes dentro de Moria.\n6\tHabla con Stilling\tGhân-gharâf se encuentra muy por debajo de las Profundidades Inundadas, más allá de una serie de cavernas parcialmente inundadas. Bróin desea que presencies el regreso de Zigilburk a Ghân-gharâf. En tu camino, hablarás con muchos de los enanos de la Guarnición de Hierro que has ayudado durante tus viajes dentro de Moria.\n7\tHabla con Slóthi\tGhân-gharâf se encuentra muy por debajo de las Profundidades Inundadas, más allá de una serie de cavernas parcialmente inundadas. Bróin desea que presencies el regreso de Zigilburk a Ghân-gharâf. En tu camino, hablarás con muchos de los enanos de la Guarnición de Hierro que has ayudado durante tus viajes dentro de Moria.\n8\tHabla con Sigdan\tGhân-gharâf se encuentra muy por debajo de las Profundidades Inundadas, más allá de una serie de cavernas parcialmente inundadas. Bróin desea que seas testigo del regreso de Zigilburk a Ghân-gharâf. En tu camino, hablarás con muchos de los enanos de la Guarnición de Hierro que has ayudado durante tus viajes por Moria.\n9\tHabla con Thálfi\tGhân-gharâf se encuentra muy por debajo de las Profundidades Inundadas, más allá de una serie de cavernas parcialmente inundadas. Bróin desea que seas testigo del regreso de Zigilburk a Ghân-gharâf. En tu camino, hablarás con muchos de los enanos de la Guarnición de Hierro que has ayudado durante tus viajes por Moria.\n10\tHabla con Wafi\tGhân-gharâf se encuentra muy por debajo de las Profundidades Inundadas, más allá de una serie de cavernas parcialmente inundadas. Bróin desea que seas testigo del regreso de Zigilburk a Ghân-gharâf. En tu camino, hablarás con muchos de los Enanos de la Guarnición de Hierro a los que has ayudado durante tus viajes por Moria.\n11\tHabla con Rink\tGhân-gharâf se encuentra muy por debajo de las Profundidades Inundadas, más allá de una serie de cavernas parcialmente inundadas. Bróin desea que seas testigo del regreso de Zigilburk a Ghân-gharâf. En tu camino, hablarás con muchos de los Enanos de la Guarnición de Hierro a los que has ayudado durante tus viajes por Moria.\n12\tHabla con Stóthkell\tGhân-gharâf se encuentra muy por debajo de las Profundidades Inundadas, más allá de una serie de cavernas parcialmente inundadas. Bróin desea que seas testigo del regreso de Zigilburk a Ghân-gharâf. En tu camino, hablarás con muchos de los Enanos de la Guarnición de Hierro a los que has ayudado durante tus viajes por Moria.\n13\tHabla con Orvar\tGhân-gharâf se encuentra muy por debajo de las Profundidades Inundadas, más allá de una serie de cavernas parcialmente inundadas. Bróin desea que seas testigo del regreso de Zigilburk a Ghân-gharâf. En tu camino, hablarás con muchos de los Enanos de la Guarnición de Hierro a los que has ayudado durante tus viajes por Moria.\n14\tHabla con Bósi.\tGhân-gharâf se encuentra muy por debajo de las Profundidades Inundadas, más allá de una serie de cavernas parcialmente inundadas. Bróin desea que seas testigo del regreso de Zigilburk a Ghân-gharâf. En tu camino, hablarás con muchos de los Enanos de la Guarnición de Hierro a los que has ayudado durante tus viajes por Moria.\n15\tHabla con Brogur.\tGhân-gharâf se encuentra muy por debajo de las Profundidades Inundadas, más allá de una serie de cavernas parcialmente inundadas. Bróin desea que seas testigo del regreso de Zigilburk a Ghân-gharâf. En tu camino, hablarás con muchos de los Enanos de la Guarnición de Hierro a los que has ayudado durante tus viajes por Moria.\n16\tHabla con Bori\tGhân-gharâf se encuentra muy por debajo de las Profundidades Inundadas, más allá de una serie de cavernas parcialmente inundadas. Bróin desea que seas testigo del regreso de Zigilburk a Ghân-gharâf. En tu camino, hablarás con muchos de los Enanos de la Guarnición de Hierro a los que has ayudado durante tus viajes por Moria.\n17\tHabla con Bróin\tGhân-gharâf se encuentra muy por debajo de las Profundidades Inundadas, más allá de una serie de cavernas parcialmente inundadas. Bróin desea que seas testigo del regreso de Zigilburk a Ghân-gharâf. En tu camino, hablarás con muchos de los Enanos de la Guarnición de Hierro a los que has ayudado durante tus viajes por Moria.\n18\tHabla con Bori\tBróin te ha dicho que le digas a Bori que Zigilburk ha sido dejado con Óin en la cámara inundada.\n19\tPresencia el sellado de Ghân-gharâf\tEstás presente para presenciar el sellado de Zigilburk.\n",
[7454]="700168CC\n1\tHabla con los enanos de la Sala Vigesimoprimera sobre el mapa\tPuedes encontrar enanos en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al oeste del Campamento de Balin. Quizás desees consultar con los enanos de la Sala Vigesimoprimera sobre el mapa que encontraste. Tal vez uno de ellos pueda ayudarte a descifrarlo.\n2\tRecoge una antorcha endeble de Páshnar\tPáshnar se encuentra al norte de Khadar-zarâm, al este de la Sala Vigesimoprimera. Geirfast cree que podrías obtener una antorcha de Páshnar, un goblin jinete de huargo. Esta antorcha te permitirá comenzar a seguir las instrucciones encontradas en el antiguo mapa.\n3\tLleva la antorcha endeble a Geirfast en la Sala Vigesimoprimera\tGeirfast se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al oeste de Khadar-zarâm. Geirfast podrá ayudarte a aprender qué hacer a continuación para revelar el tesoro del mapa.\n4\tRecolección de ícor de gusanos de las profundidades (total: 2)\tEl ícor se puede encontrar en los gusanos de las profundidades entre Khadar-zarâm y el Puente de Khazad-dûm, al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera. Para continuar con el siguiente paso de la fabricación de la antorcha, Geirfast te ha dicho que necesita ícor de los gusanos de las profundidades de Nud-melek.\n5\tLleva el ícor de los gusanos de las profundidades a Geirfast en la Sala Vigesimoprimera\tGeirfast se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noroeste de Khadar-zarâm. Geirfast estará ansioso por comenzar a convertir el ícor en una pasta para la antorcha.\n6\tRecolecta mineral de narfulz (total: 2)\tEl mineral de narfulz se puede encontrar en el lado oeste del Puente de Khazad-dûm, al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera. El siguiente paso en las instrucciones del mapa para construir la antorcha implica el procesamiento del mineral de narfulz, un metal conocido por prenderse fuego cuando se muele en polvo.\n7\tLleva el mineral de narfulz a Geirfast en la Sala Vigesimoprimera\tGeirfast se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noroeste del Puente de Khazad-dûm. Geirfast querrá comenzar a procesar el mineral de narfulz en polvo para la antorcha.\n",
[7455]="70015682\n1\tRecoge lanzas de los orcos en Skrithûrz-ulíma\tLos orcos que empuñan lanzas pueden encontrarse en Skrithûrz-ulíma, al noroeste de la Guardia Orca. Los orcos están utilizando lanzas robadas de los antiguos arsenales de armas de Moria.\n2\tRecoge lanzas de los orcos de la Mano Blanca en Skrithûrz-ulíma (total: 10)\tLos orcos que empuñan lanzas pueden encontrarse en Skrithûrz-ulíma, al noroeste de la Guardia Orca. Los orcos están utilizando lanzas robadas de los antiguos arsenales de armas de Moria.\n3\tCompletado\tHas recuperado muchas lanzas antiguas de los orcos de Skrithûrz-ulíma.\n",
[7456]="7006C579\n1\tDefeat the Courier\tNangar suggested the courier carrying orders to the south will pass a ruined khanâg along the eastern road from Jirush. He suggested you ambush the courier and his escort there and seize the parcel he carries.\n2\tBring the Ordâkhin missive to Nangar in Jirush\tYou recovered a single missive, written in Ordâkhin, from the courier. Take the letter to Nangar in Jirush.\n3\tBring the letter to Galamê for translation\tNangar asked you to trust him and deliver the letter you recovered to Galamê. Galamê can, and will translate the letter.\n4\tHabla con Nangar\tNangar's words were true. Galamê made the translation quietly and did not ask how it was obtained. He handed a translation back to you alongside the original document. Return the messages to Nangar in Jirush.\n",
})
